stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> EmptyComposer

    EmptyComposer --> DraftSaved: User types in Side Pane (450ms auto-save)
    DraftSaved --> DraftSaved: Continued typing or tab switch recovery
    DraftSaved --> EmptyComposer: User clears input

    DraftSaved --> Parked: "+ Park Idea" or Ctrl+Enter (app_save_item)
    EmptyComposer --> Parked: Agent calls park_prompt from chat

    state Parked {
        [*] --> NormalPriority
        NormalPriority --> HighPriority: Set priority = high
        NormalPriority --> LowPriority: Set priority = low
        HighPriority --> PinnedTop: Toggle pin = true
        NormalPriority --> PinnedTop: Toggle pin = true
        LowPriority --> PinnedTop: Toggle pin = true
    }

    Parked --> AttachedContext: Toggle "Attach" (updateModelContext)
    AttachedContext --> Parked: Detach or Clear

    Parked --> BatchSelected: Check multi-select box
    BatchSelected --> Parked: Uncheck

    Parked --> CompletedDone: "Send Here" / "New Chat" (auto-mark done) or "Done"
    BatchSelected --> CompletedDone: "Send (N)" or Batch "Done"

    CompletedDone --> Parked: Click "Reopen"
    Parked --> [*]: Click "Delete" (app_delete_item)
    CompletedDone --> [*]: Click "Delete" or "Clear Done"
